<title>USA: CKE Restaurants closes Hardee's acquisition.</title>
<headline>CKE Restaurants closes Hardee's acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>ANAHEIM, Calif. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>CKE Restaurants Inc said Wednesday it has completed the acquisition of Hardee's Food Systems Inc from Imasco Ltd.</p>
<p>CKE said in a statement it paid $327 million subject to adjustment upon receipt of an audited balance sheet as of July 15. The acquisition was financed by $104.1 million from bank borrowings and $222.9 million from a secondary offering of CKE common stock.</p>
</text>
